{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"root","type":"text","text":"# LLM（对话）发展史\n从一次性对话工具，逐步发展为能执行复杂任务的智能体系统。","x":-920,"y":1460,"width":520,"height":170,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"## 1. 大语言模型（LLM）","x":-240,"y":0,"width":430,"height":90,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"s1-1","type":"text","text":"### 1.1 基本功能","x":340,"y":0,"width":360,"height":80,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"s1-1-detail","type":"text","text":"- 对话，本质上类似“词语接龙”。\n- 早期能力特点：\n  - 只能完成一次有质量的对话，即“一问一答”。\n  - 不能追问，缺少连续上下文理解能力。","x":860,"y":-25,"width":620,"height":190,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"## 2. 对话能力的增强","x":-240,"y":370,"width":430,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s2-1","type":"text","text":"### 2.1 提示词 Prompt","x":340,"y":255,"width":360,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s2-1-detail","type":"text","text":"- 实质：提问的问题。\n- 作用：告诉 LLM 当前要回答什么。","x":860,"y":245,"width":560,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s2-2","type":"text","text":"### 2.2 上下文 Context","x":340,"y":405,"width":360,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s2-2-detail","type":"text","text":"- 实质：背景信息。\n- 作用：给 LLM 补充回答所需的前置信息。","x":860,"y":395,"width":560,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s2-3","type":"text","text":"### 2.3 记忆 Memory","x":340,"y":565,"width":360,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s2-3-detail","type":"text","text":"- 实质：把历史信息交给 LLM 压缩后，作为“上下文”加载到新的输入中。\n- 实现效果：\n  - 多轮次对话\n  - 可以追问\n  - 对话不再只是一次性问答","x":860,"y":530,"width":680,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"## 3. 智能体 Agent","x":-240,"y":880,"width":430,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s3-1","type":"text","text":"### 3.1 Agent 的实质","x":340,"y":790,"width":360,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s3-1-detail","type":"text","text":"- 附带固定运行逻辑的程序。","x":860,"y":785,"width":520,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s3-2","type":"text","text":"### 3.2 Agent 的目的","x":340,"y":940,"width":360,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s3-2-detail","type":"text","text":"- 减少人与 LLM 沟通的次数。\n- 处理 LLM 无法直接操作的任务。","x":860,"y":925,"width":560,"height":120,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"## 4. Agent 获取模型参数以外信息的能力","x":-240,"y":1370,"width":480,"height":110,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s4-1","type":"text","text":"### 4.1 联网搜索 Web Search","x":340,"y":1195,"width":390,"height":90,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s4-1-detail","type":"text","text":"- 实现：上网。\n- 作用：让 Agent/LLM 获取互联网上的实时或外部信息。","x":860,"y":1180,"width":620,"height":130,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s4-2","type":"text","text":"### 4.2 向量数据库搜索 Search","x":340,"y":1365,"width":390,"height":90,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s4-2-detail","type":"text","text":"- 实现：本地搜索。\n- 作用：从本地知识库、文档库中检索相关信息。","x":860,"y":1350,"width":620,"height":130,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s4-3","type":"text","text":"### 4.3 检索增强生成 RAG","x":340,"y":1545,"width":390,"height":90,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s4-3-detail","type":"text","text":"- 全称：Retrieval-Augmented Generation。\n- 实质：通过搜索本地向量数据库，把语义相近的内容检索出来，并加入到 Context 中。\n- 目的：增强生成内容的可靠性。","x":860,"y":1515,"width":700,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"## 5. Agent 与 LLM 之间：规范","x":-240,"y":1930,"width":480,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s5-1","type":"text","text":"### 5.1 约定 Function Calling","x":340,"y":1815,"width":410,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s5-1-detail","type":"text","text":"- 目的：规定 Agent 与 LLM 之间沟通的格式。\n- 作用：提升沟通质量，让 LLM 可以更稳定地调用外部功能。","x":860,"y":1800,"width":660,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s5-2","type":"text","text":"### 5.2 模型上下文协议 MCP","x":340,"y":2010,"width":410,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s5-2-detail","type":"text","text":"- 全称：Model Context Protocol。\n- 目的：把 Agent 中的功能从 Agent 里解耦出来。\n- 作用：形成一种 Agent 调用外部功能的协议。\n- 可以理解为：让不同工具、功能、数据源能以统一方式接入 Agent。","x":860,"y":1980,"width":720,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"## 6. Agent 与用户之间：交互","x":-240,"y":2520,"width":480,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s6-1","type":"text","text":"### 6.1 用户直接参与非 LLM 部分的功能建设","x":340,"y":2295,"width":460,"height":110,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s6-1-detail","type":"text","text":"- 方式一：编程，例如 LangChain。\n- 方式二：低代码工作流 Workflow。","x":860,"y":2290,"width":620,"height":120,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s6-2","type":"text","text":"### 6.2 同类功能的整合 Skills","x":340,"y":2495,"width":460,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s6-2-detail","type":"text","text":"- Skills 用于把相似或相关的能力组织起来。\n- 作用：让 Agent 能调用一组更结构化、更可复用的能力。","x":860,"y":2480,"width":680,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s6-3","type":"text","text":"### 6.3 子 Agent SubAgent","x":340,"y":2705,"width":460,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s6-3-detail","type":"text","text":"- 实现目的：\n  - 上下文隔离。\n  - 降低 LLM 处理单个对话时的 token 长度。\n- 作用：把复杂任务拆成多个子任务，由不同子 Agent 处理。","x":860,"y":2670,"width":700,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s7","type":"text","text":"## 7. 图中最后的对比关系","x":-240,"y":3210,"width":480,"height":100,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"s7-trend","type":"text","text":"### 整体趋势","x":340,"y":2960,"width":360,"height":80,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"s7-trend-detail","type":"text","text":"从传统程序到 Agent 能力，整体趋势是：\n\n- 从稳定、刚性\n- 走向变化、柔性","x":860,"y":2935,"width":560,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"s7-map","type":"text","text":"### 对应关系","x":340,"y":3165,"width":360,"height":80,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"s7-map-detail","type":"text","text":"- LangChain：偏编程、框架化\n- Workflow：偏工作流、低代码\n- Skill：偏技能封装\n- Agent：偏智能体能力整合","x":860,"y":3140,"width":620,"height":180,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"s7-core","type":"text","text":"### 核心主线","x":340,"y":3405,"width":360,"height":80,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"s7-core-detail","type":"text","text":"LLM 最开始只是一次性对话工具，后来通过 Prompt、Context、Memory 支持多轮对话；再往后，通过 Agent 获得搜索、工具调用、RAG、MCP、Skills、SubAgent 等能力，逐渐从“聊天模型”发展成“能执行复杂任务的智能体系统”。","x":860,"y":3370,"width":760,"height":190,"color":"2"}
	],
